        "b": 681.228024736033
      },
      "content": "A flow regulator is incorporated into the cassette distal end. This flow regulator is used to manually control flow when the cassette is not inserted in the infuser. When the cassette is properly inserted into the infuser and the door is closed, a mechanism opens the flow regulator to allow the infuser to control fluid flow. When the door is opened, the same mechanism closes the flow regulator to disable fluid flow.",
